# ABP Solution Templates

## Available Templates

### Layered Web Application (`app`)
- Full DDD layered architecture
- Separate projects per layer
- Best for complex business applications

### Single-Layer Web Application (`app-nolayers`)
- All code in single project
- Simpler structure
- Best for smaller applications

### Module Template (`module`)
- For creating reusable modules
- Multi-database provider support
- Proper layer separation

### Microservice Template
- Multiple services
- API gateway
- Service mesh ready

### Console Application (`console`)
- Simple console app
- ABP module system
- Good for background services

## Creating Solutions
```bash
# Layered app with Blazor and EF Core
abp new MyProject -t app -u blazor -d ef

# Single layer with MVC
abp new MyProject -t app-nolayers -u mvc

# Module
abp new MyModule -t module

# Microservice
abp new MyMicroservice -t microservice
```
